{"script":"yd_012_09-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":277.5,"y":-419,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"y":-419,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]现在想想大兽潮的那时候，我擅自从巴诺姆村带着一支部队出击的做法确实有些不妥了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]当时我认为巴诺姆村不应该龟缩在山上自守，而是应该主动出击和联军一起打击魔物潮。但是我这个想法当时遭到了工头的反对。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]包括他在内的大部分人认为魔物短时间上不来，就算来了也可以在山上打保卫战。[r]我当时就觉得这个说法很扯，要是下面的联军打不过魔物潮，我们这些老弱病残又怎么可能是对手呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]我因此和工头爆发了激烈的争吵，最后我气不过带着一帮部队擅自下山去支援了。[r]虽然战果不算差，但我从此以后便不再受村子待见了，我最后也选择了离开。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]当时我还尚不成熟，用词和行为都有些过激。[r]如果再让我选择一次的话，我还是会下山支援，不过我会用更温和的方式和大家协商沟通。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]毕竟在大多数时候，无法理解的双方，就需要靠着沟通去慢慢化解矛盾啊……[r]我因为年轻时的冲劲，失去了多少朋友呢……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"y":-419,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-年轻的冲劲"}